[REQUIREMENT]
UID: A02
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Sign out
STATEMENT: >>>
An authenticated user signs out. ReqAML terminates the server session, clears the client session handle,
revokes any desk attachments for that session, and records an auditable logout event.
Subsequent API calls with the old handle receive an unauthorized outcome.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: requirement
BASE_UID: A02
VERSION_N: 0
rbac_op: auth:signout
priority: 20
iteration: iter-r0
security.catalog_ref: AC-12
security.verification_note: AC-12 session termination; AU-2/3/12 logout audit. ASD STIG V6R4 V-222578 / V-222391 / V-222550.
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-SSO
in_scope_of_contract: Design-2026-10
in_scope_of_contract: Security package
in_scope_of_contract: Fixture doc-walk
delivered_by_release: R0-sequences
edge: → conforms_to to AC-12 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
edge: → conforms_to to V-222578 (pin imprint=asd-stig@v6r4)
edge: → conforms_to to V-222391 (pin imprint=asd-stig@v6r4)
