[REQUIREMENT]
UID: A04
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Clear / change Scoped View
STATEMENT: >>>
A user clears or changes Client Scoped View. ReqAML updates or clears the server-side active client binding,
invalidates client-scoped caches for the prior binding, and audits the scope change.
Project routes that require a scoped client refuse to proceed until a valid view is selected again.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: requirement
BASE_UID: A04
VERSION_N: 0
rbac_op: client:scope:clear
priority: 30
iteration: iter-r0
security.catalog_ref: AC-3
security.verification_note: AC-3 access enforcement on scope clear/change. ASD STIG V6R4 V-222578 / V-222389.
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-SCOPED-VIEW
in_scope_of_contract: Design-2026-10
in_scope_of_contract: Security package
delivered_by_release: R0-sequences
edge: → conforms_to to AC-12 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
edge: → conforms_to to V-222578 (pin imprint=asd-stig@v6r4)
edge: → conforms_to to V-222389 (pin imprint=asd-stig@v6r4)
edge: → conforms_to to AC-3 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
<<<
