[REQUIREMENT]
UID: A06
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Invite / link identity
STATEMENT: >>>
An admin invites or links an identity to a client or project. ReqAML records the external IdP subject
binding, creates or updates the identity row, and audits who linked whom.
Invitation does not by itself grant project roles; grant create (A07) is a separate mutating step.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: requirement
BASE_UID: A06
VERSION_N: 0
rbac_op: identity:link
priority: 50
iteration: iter-r0
security.catalog_ref: IA-2
security.verification_note: IA-2/AC-2 account/identity linkage; AU-2/3/12 admin actions. ASD STIG V6R4 V-222542 / V-222407.
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-RBAC
in_scope_of_contract: Design-2026-10
in_scope_of_contract: Security package
