[REQUIREMENT]
UID: A11
STATUS: Active
TITLE: List project access
STATEMENT: >>>
A project admin or auditor lists who has access to a project. ReqAML returns identity display names,
emails, and active roles filtered by the caller's permission to view grants.
The response is read-only and does not expose other projects' grant tables.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: requirement
BASE_UID: A11
VERSION_N: 0
rbac_op: project:grant:list
priority: 45
iteration: iter-r1
security.catalog_ref: AC-3
security.verification_note: AC-3 least disclosure of grant listings; AU optional. ASD STIG V6R4 V-222430.
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-RBAC
in_scope_of_contract: Design-2026-10
in_scope_of_contract: Security package
