STATEMENT: >>>
An Author marks content obsolete or withdrawn. Terminal obsolete/withdraw WITHOUT a replacement tip is an in-place status change on the current tip (or a status-only .N with mint_kind=status, exempt from content no-op and NOT clearing ApprovalRecord). When a replacement tip exists, the prior tip becomes superseded via D04 activate — not a separate obsolete successor required for every replacement. Tombstoned lines disappear from default tree views. Soft-delete remains auditable (ARCH-VER-TOMB / AU-12).
