KIND: requirement
BASE_UID: ARCH-VER
VERSION_N: 0
priority: 5
iteration: iter-r0
security.catalog_ref: AC-3
security.verification_note: AC-3 access enforcement; AU-2/3/12 where mutating.
edge: ← uses from ARCH-API
edge: ← uses from C03
edge: ← uses from FIX-ALLOW-STATUS-SUPERSEDE
in_scope_of_contract: Design-2026-10
in_scope_of_contract: Platform baseline
delivered_by_release: R0-sequences
