[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-VER-TOMB
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Tombstone via obsolete version
STATEMENT: >>>
Soft-delete of a line is expressed by obsolete or withdrawn status (in-place terminal, or status-only .N) — not by deleting requirement_line rows. When replaced by a newer tip, prior active becomes superseded in-place (D04). Historical contracts and releases that delivered prior UIDs remain coherent (may be marked trace_suspect). Succession and tombstone events are auditable (AU-12).
<<<
