STATUS: Active
TITLE: ApprovalRecord on line (SoT); version mirror dual-write
STATEMENT: >>>
Stakeholder / solution approval SoT is ApprovalRecord on the line (subject_kind RequirementLine or CapabilityLine; status unapproved|approved; by, at, notes; approved_version_uid; approved_statement_hash) — NOT a lifecycle status and NOT version-only. D04 activate remains draft→active only. D08 and other profile-gated planning actions read ApprovalRecord on the line (ARCH-APPROVAL-LINE). Approver roles come from RoleBinding on the WorkflowProfile (ARCH-APPROVER-SLOTS) — never hard-coded Client admin vs AO in the engine. Dogfood commercial profile binds stakeholder → Client admin; DoD example profile may bind AO / Project admin. During migrate, requirement_version.stakeholder_approval may dual-write as a mirror; clearing and gate evaluation always use the line ApprovalRecord + hash.
