BASE_UID: H03
VERSION_N: 0
rbac_op: catalog:publish
priority: 55
iteration: iter-r2
security.catalog_ref: REQAML-SEC-CATALOG
security.verification_note: Catalog steward gates; standard catalogs imprint-published read-only. AC-3/CM-5 aligned. Pins are (imprint_id, item_uid).
