STATUS: Active
TITLE: Drift review: successor, grandfather, or withdraw
STATEMENT: >>>
Author or Security reviews catalog_drift and chooses: (a) mint a successor .N that ConformsTo the new imprint item (optional review work item), (b) keep the grandfathered pin on the prior imprint until a contract allows a bump, or (c) withdraw conformance if the control was withdrawn/gone.
