[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-CHANGESET-RBAC
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Change-set RBAC (permission-tree: SDLC parent vs leaf)
STATEMENT: >>>
Change-set RBAC follows permission-tree.html (preferred over flat matrix where they disagree): open leaf = Author, Developer, Tester, Release manager, Security, Catalog steward, Project admin, Client admin (not Reader/AO/Auditor). Open/close SDLC parent = Author, Security (security sessions), Project admin, Client admin (client scope) — Developer is leaf-only and cannot open SDLC parent. Revert/re-apply = Author (own objects+rights), Security (security objects), Project/Client admin — not Developer. Read history = all roles.
<<<
