[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-SUSPECT
STATUS: Active
TITLE: trace_suspect on edges/junctions after content .N
STATEMENT: >>>
When a target line receives a content mint_kind=.N, inbound trace edges (satisfies/refines/uses) and contract in_scope_of / release delivers junctions that pin a prior version of that line are marked trace_suspect=true. Pin-only migrate (mint_kind=pin) updates the ConformsTo pin and does NOT suspect that pin. Generalizes catalog_drift to internal traces (P1-1). Detect bed: edge FIX-CONTRACT-DOC-NOCTX → FIX-SUCC-2HOP.1 (stale uses on superseded UID).
